<title>UK: Yorkshire Group warns on sterling strength.</title>
<headline>Yorkshire Group warns on sterling strength.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK speciality chemicals group Yorkshire Group Plc said on Friday that a continuation of sterling strength would have an adverse effect on profits this year.</p>
</text>
